Create Or Replace View VWCAJ_Recibos_Detalle_Ctas
As Select T1.McaCve, T3.McaDes, T2.RecNum, T2.PerAno, T2.PerNum,
       T9.FecIso, T2.MovCve,
       T4.MovDes, T2.IngVal, T1.MovSec, T1.CtaCve, T1.AuxCve,
(Case When T1.AuxCve = 0 Then T5.CtaDes Else T6.AuxNom End)
Descripcion, T1.IngVtr, T1.DcaOri
   From CajRecd T1
   Join CajRech T2
     On (T1.McaCve = T2.McaCve)
    And (T1.RecNum = T2.RecNum)
   Join CajMca T3
     On (T1.McaCve = T3.McaCve)
   Join CajMovh T4
     On (T2.MovCve = T4.MovCve)
   Join CogCta T5
     On (T1.CtaCve = T5.CtaCve)
Left Outer Join CogAuxd T6
     On (T5.AuxLis = T6.AuxLis)
    And (T1.AuxCve = T6.AuxCve)
   Join SegFec T9
     On (T2.IngAno = T9.FecAno)
    And (T2.IngMes = T9.FecMes)
    And (T2.IngDia = T9.FecDia)
  Where (T2.SitCve = 'P')
